cheri alla Carbonara", "variant": null, "source_price": 14, "raw_cost": 2.6985, "confidence": "Media", "notes": "Sostituiti 50g Parmigiano con 50g Pecorino del menù (€20,03/kg); pepe/extra 0,04€.", "review": "", "source_row": 25, "base_cost": 2.931, "correction": -0.2725, "market_extra": 0.04}, {"id": "excel-26", "menu_key": "spaghetti_pomodoro_basilico", "approved": true, "name": "Spaghetti Pomodoro", "variant": null, "source_price": 12.5, "raw_cost": 1.78396, "confidence": "Media", "notes": "Sugo 120g più pomodori freschi 300g già valorizzati; extra olio/basilico 0,14€.", "review": "", "source_row": 26, "base_cost": 1.64396, "correction": 0, "market_extra": 0.14}, {"id": "excel-27", "menu_key": "arrosticini_abruzzesi", "approved": true, "name": "Arrosticini abruzzesi", "variant": null, "source_price": 22.5, "raw_cost": 7.29989091, "confidence": "Bassa", "notes": "Ricetta 12×25g; carta 8×30g=240g. Corretti a 240g al prezzo carne delle fatture; extra 0,13€.", "review": "", "source_row": 27, "base_cost": 8.77009091, "correction": -1.6002, "market_extra": 0.13}, {"id": "excel-28", "menu_key": "lingote_cerdo", "approved": true, "name": "Lingotto di maiale", "variant": null, "source_price": 30, "raw_cost": 2.878, "confidence": "Bassa", "notes": "Originale include solo 250g maiale+carota; aggiunte patate, verdure, marinatura e olio ~1,05€.", "review": "", "source_row": 28, "base_cost": 1.828, "correction": 0, "market_extra": 1.05}, {"id": "excel-29", "menu_key": "tagliata_ternera_rucula_grana_pachino", "approved": false, "name": "Tagliata di ternera", "variant": null, "source_price": 35, "raw_cost": 6.5195, "confidence": "Media", "notes": "300g cuadril in ricetta, confermare taglio servito; olio ~0,12€.", "review": "Ternera nel file, vitello in carta", "source_row": 29, "base_cost": 6.3995, "correction": 0, "market_extra": 0.12}, {"id": "excel-30", "menu_key": "papas_al_horno", "approved": true, "name": "Papas al horno", "variant": null, "source_price": 6, "raw_cost": 0.